    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Yapori Minigames is a singleplayer game with several minigames, different game modes, several playable characters and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different minigames and challenges, such as the asteroid minigame, where you have to dodge asteroids until time runs out, the soccer minigame, where you have to score a specific number of goals before time runs out to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5 skins to unlock, such as Darkpori, a fox with a white scarf and blue shoes, Aybo who is an intelligent and somewhat annoying robot, Jack a crazy yellow monkey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes that vary in different gameplay, such as Music Mode and Platform Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p>",
